# Figma To Code Requirements

When implementing any section from Figma in this project:

- Use design tokens and utility classes from `src/styles/figma_var.css`.
- Use project assets from `public/` (prefer existing files over remote URLs).
- Use icon components from `src/icons/` instead of inline SVG duplication.
- Follow Astro component patterns already used in `src/pages/Home/_components/`.
- Preserve visual fidelity to the selected Figma node while keeping responsive behavior.
- Use `rem` units by default for sizing/spacing/typography; avoid `px` unless strictly necessary.
- Always use the existing responsive breakpoints from `src/styles/figma_var.css` (`dk-lg`, `dk`, `tb`, `mb`) for responsive behavior.
